    <string name="help_title">Cover screen setup</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Open Settings › Cover screen › Widgets and add one or more \"Container N\" widgets.\n\n2. Configure the content of each container from this app.\n\n3. The widgets are drawn directly inside the container on the cover screen. Use the ‹ › buttons to change page.\n\nWidgets are rendered as images and refresh live. A tap is forwarded to the widget element under your finger (approximate, 8×8 grid). Allow notifications so the refresh service can keep running.</string>
